  "description": "The practice exam will become available on September\u202f1,\u202f2026, and students will have a 90\u2011minute window to complete it. Unlimited variants are enabled, and for every question the system will draw from four different variants.\n\nThe test is organized into two zones. In the **Algebra Basics** zone there are two questions: **ALG101**, worth 5 points, and **ALG102**, which can be scored either 10 points or an alternate 5\u2011point version. The **Geometry** zone contains a single question, **GEO201**, valued at 8 points. The overview page will display the following message: `<p>Welcome to the practice exam. Please read each question carefully.</p>`."
